{
  "schema": "qbit.prism.load-preset.v1",
  "name": "short-plan-20k-window-1fe",
  "description": "The short plan over throughput-20k-window-1fe's fixture, for #541's runner probe: 2,000 sessions on one frontend, asynchronous standby, a 20k window, 50 shares/s through warm-up, steady state, reconnect and the slow database, no burst. One payout address, as throughput-20k-window-1fe.",
